src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"The first lap was completed with Nuvolari making his way through the field.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Nuvolari passes Tadini, Varzi and Sandri on the first straight and leads after two laps, with a 1m43.8s lap.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Nuvolari steadily increased his lead over Varzi, who was threatened by Comotti and Tadini.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":5,"text":"On the fifth lap Nuvolari had an eight seconds advantage over Varzi, with a further gap of seven seconds to Tadini and another six seconds to Comotti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Varzi laps in 1m44.6s trying to regain ground; Nuvolari keeps lapping in 1m46s or 1m47s.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":12,"text":"Pellegrini stops briefly with a wheel failure.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":16,"text":"Comotti retired with an engine failure on lap 16.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":20,"text":"Varzi holds a slight advantage over Tadini; Ghersi and Sandri have passed Comotti.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"On the 25th lap, Tadini closed up and passed Varzi, advancing into second place, but Nuvolari had a lead of one minute over them.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"On the last lap Tadini, some 14 seconds ahead of Varzi, spins at the War Monument bend; Varzi snatches second.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"Nuvolari wins by over a minute; Barbieri is fourth, Ghersi fifth with broken suspension, Sandri sixth.","q":false,"c":0}]}